Say "start Phase 8 Batch 21" or "start Direction F" — agent reads STATE.md first, runs
the 9-point pre-flight, then emits BUILD BATCH PROPOSAL with explicit branch-creation
line. Or pick alternative direction explicitly: "start Direction B" / "start Direction
C" / "start Direction D".
